    narr:narration """As of August 2026, Dave Quantum has initiated a [strategic infrastructure migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_1), moving the organization's analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB. This shift is framed through a [dual-justification of performance and cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_2), specifically citing a 10x improvement in analytical query speeds. The [decision is presented as settled](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_3) rather than consultative, with [specific performance metrics](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_4) and a [defined Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_5) serving to solidify the transition. The discourse remains consistently technical and authoritative, focusing on the competence-based rationale for the change.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Performance gain**: 10x analytical queries" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "While the core decision is presented as a technical necessity, the timeline entry introduces a note of organizational pressure absent from the performance-focused claims." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "Direct and decisive; the voice treats the migration as a closed matter of fact." ; narr:text "Declares the migration decision as settled." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "Technical and matter-of-fact; the register prioritizes efficiency and performance metrics." ; narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_2> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "temporal" ; narr:reading "Anchored in the present reality of the decision, with a firm gaze toward a concrete future execution." ; narr:text "**Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786354993074_5> ] ;
